courier.name = Courier Satchel
courier.description = A sturdy delivery satchel. Equip it through a townsfolk profile to carry one additional stack per trip. Crafted by townsfolk.
smith.name = Smith's Tool Roll
smith.description = Well balanced tools for the forge. Equip through a townsfolk profile for 15% faster blacksmithing and armor crafting. Does not speed up furnaces or change skill requirements. Crafted by townsfolk.
courierpack.name = Quartermaster Pack
courierpack.description = A reinforced pack with room for two additional stacks per delivery. Replaces the equipped profession kit. Its crafting recipe is a reward from Mara Finch.
fieldledger.name = Field Ledger
fieldledger.description = Right click inside your town to open warehouse storage. Requires a resident Warehouse Manager and storage permission. A reputation reward from Mara Finch.
botanist.name = Botanist's Tool Roll
botanist.description = Equip through a townsfolk profile for 15% faster crop tending, herb planting and harvesting. Does not speed up plant growth. Its crafting plans are a friendship reward.
alchemist.name = Brewer's Case
alchemist.description = Equip through a townsfolk profile for 15% faster brewing. Does not change ingredient costs or skill requirements. Its crafting plans are a friendship reward.
cook.name = Chef's Utensil Roll
cook.description = Equip through a townsfolk profile for 15% faster cooking work. Food support, ingredient costs and skill requirements stay the same. Replaces the equipped profession kit. Crafted by townsfolk.
jeweler.name = Jeweler's Case
jeweler.description = Equip through a townsfolk profile for 15% faster jewelry crafting. Does not improve rarity or replace an Appraisal Bench. Replaces the equipped profession kit. Crafted by townsfolk.
rancher.name = Ranchhand's Bag
rancher.description = Equip through a townsfolk profile for 15% faster ranch tending. Food support and the time before neglect stay the same. Replaces the equipped profession kit. Crafted by townsfolk.
mastersmith.name = Master Smith's Chest
mastersmith.description = Equip through a townsfolk profile for 25% faster blacksmithing and armor crafting. Does not speed up furnaces or change skill requirements. Replaces the equipped profession kit. Crafted by townsfolk.
crafter.name = Joiner's Toolbox
crafter.description = Equip through a townsfolk profile for 15% faster crafting work. Replaces the equipped profession kit. Skill requirements and material costs stay the same.
patterncabinet.name = Pattern Cabinet
patterncabinet.description = Place inside a crafting workplace for 10% faster attended work. Duplicates do not stack. Does not replace the required workbench. Crafted by townsfolk from friendship plans.
leatherworker.name = Leatherworker's Roll
leatherworker.description = Equip through a townsfolk profile for 15% faster leatherworking work. Replaces the equipped profession kit. Skill requirements and material costs stay the same.
stitchingframe.name = Stitching Frame
stitchingframe.description = Place inside a leatherworking workplace for 10% faster attended work. Duplicates do not stack. Does not replace the required workbench. Crafted by townsfolk from friendship plans.
